summary:
  The retry ladder arms whether or not the listener switched it off.

history:
  A listener on issue #13 asked to be able to stop the widget knocking at a
  station that had gone quiet, keeping only the resume that follows the
  network coming back. Those are separate roads already, which is what made
  the switch a small change: the ladder arms in exactly one function, so one
  guard covers it. The mutant removes that guard — the setting still appears
  in the settings page, still saves, and does nothing at all, which is the
  worst shape this kind of bug takes.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          if (Plasmoid.configuration.autoRetry !== true) return;

replace:
          if (false) return;

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_retry_switch_gates_the_ladder_and_not_the_network.
  Line-neutral.
